Things NOT to genocide:

    Trolls - tried this once:  they came back (v3.0)
    low-level nasties - use as alter gifts(rev genocide)

If you get a scroll of genocide at a low level, and you don't know about
the higher level nasties, or would like to survive to a higher level, try
some of these to genocide (there will always be other genocide scrolls (or
blank paper/magic markers)

Things to genocide at low levels:
    Rust monsters and other creatuse who rust your stuff
    q's - they hit far too many times...(REALLY bad when frozen, petrefied,
          or for some reason can't move!)
    S's - many a quaffer has been killed by a water moccasin at a fountain.
    h,G,o's - makes the mines and throne rooms a snap!

